{"line":1,"escaped":"The scanline overlay is now wired over the full 1920\\u{00D7}1080 frame in `index.html`, using the registry's `yt-screen-warp` component (\"On-Screen Display Effect\"). Lint passes with 0 errors, but I could not render or snapshot a frame because this machine has no Chrome or ffmpeg, so the look is unverified visually.\\u{000A}","points":[[53,"U+00D7"],[311,"U+000A"]]}
