{"line":1,"escaped":"The composition now has the registry's `yt-screen-warp` component (\"On-Screen Display Effect\") wired over the whole frame. `hyperframes lint` passes with 0 errors and 0 warnings, but I could not render frames to check it visually: no Chrome is installed here and the download failed.\\u{000A}","points":[[284,"U+000A"]]}
